{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5d3677a8-529a-820a-8e83-0807fa6cd59c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T10:41:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:37:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, madam. Thank you for taking my call. My name is Isabel Amaral. I am calling because I received a parking ticket, and I believe it is not correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number, or your license plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:38:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it here. The violation says I parked too close to a fire hydrant. This is on Eustis Avenue, near number 422. I live close to there, in the Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:38:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Can you read me the ticket number from the top of the slip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One moment, please. [pause] It is the number, ah, 40 and then 7 7 1 2 9. That is what it says. The writing is very small."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:38:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have it here. It shows a hydrant violation issued Saturday. What is it you dispute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:38:48-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The distance. The officer wrote that I was inside the limit, but I measured the next day with a tape. My car was more than the distance from the hydrant. I am sure of it. It is not fair, I think, to pay for something that I did not do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Measurements like that are something the reviewer would consider, but I can't change the violation from this desk. A dispute has to be made in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:39:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, in writing, that is fine. Where do I send the written appeal? To City Hall? To which office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes to the Finance Department, attention parking ticket appeals, at City Hall, on Broadway. Include your ticket number, your plate, and your explanation. Photographs are helpful too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photographs, yes, I have two photographs. And the tape measure is in one of them. Good. And I have how many days to send it? You said at the beginning something about the hour, no, sorry, I did not hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:39:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I didn't give a time yet. Are you asking about the deadline to appeal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the deadline. Sorry. I thought you said it must arrive by nine at night, or something. The line is not so clear from my phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. I said nothing about nine. The deadline is a number of days printed on the ticket itself, near the bottom. Please check it there, and keep to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:40:29-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, near the bottom. [pause] Yes, I see it. Okay. So it is printed here. Good. And if I send the appeal, I do not pay now, correct? Because it is already a bit annoying that they put this ticket on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:40:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Once a written appeal is filed, the ticket goes under review. If it is denied, you'll be notified by mail and given the next steps. Please do keep a copy of everything you send."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will keep copies. Will someone call me, in case they need something? My number is 401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, I've noted 401-555-0187 on the file. Mostly they respond by mail to the address you give, so please write it clearly in your letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Four twenty-two Eustis Avenue. Thank you for your help, madam. I hope the officer reads it carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:41:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Amaral. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:41:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
